WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:01.250
What are you doing?

00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:04.400
Just give her the coat, Nick.

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:06.470
So much weird crap happens in this apartment.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:07.970
He's really sorry.

00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:13.840
God.

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:15.610
Well, I guess the old Nick is back, huh?

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:19.240
Yeah. I'm going to miss trench coat, Nick.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:20.080
He was pretty great.

00:00:20.110 --> 00:00:21.010
I might miss him.

00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:23.520
I liked him. His guts.

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:26.970
It was a woman's coat.

00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:27.630
Good night, Nick.

00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:28.130
Good night.

00:00:48.260 --> 00:00:49.700
I meant something like that.

00:01:06.490 --> 00:01:07.760
Uh... Oh.

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:12.670
Hey, babe. Do you mind if I put this
somewhere else? It's kind of...

00:01:12.670 --> 00:01:15.190
It's kind of creeping me out. I'm trying to go to sleep.

00:01:15.980 --> 00:01:18.260
Yeah, that's fine. That's cool. That's fine.

